        <section class="premium-panel input-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><span class="step-index">01</span><strong>输入素材</strong></div><small>INPUT SOURCE</small></div><div class="compact-tabs"><button type="button" :class="{ active: inputMode === 'upload' }" @click="inputMode = 'upload'"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">upload_file</span>本地上传</button><button type="button" :class="{ active: inputMode === 'url' }" @click="inputMode = 'url'"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">link</span>视频地址</button></div><div v-if="inputMode === 'upload'" class="compact-drop" @click="fileInput?.click()" @dragover.prevent @drop.prevent="onDrop"><input ref="fileInput" type="file" accept="video/*" hidden @change="onFile"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">movie</span><strong>{{ hasVideo ? '视频已载入' : '拖拽或点击上传' }}</strong><small>MP4 / MOV · 最大 500MB</small></div><div v-else class="compact-url"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">link</span><input v-model="videoUrl" placeholder="粘贴视频链接"><button type="button" @click="parseUrl">解析</button></div></section>
        <section class="premium-panel type-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><span class="step-index">02</span><strong>视频类型</strong></div><small>ANALYSIS MODE</small></div><div class="pill-switch"><button type="button" :class="{ active: videoType === 'ai' }" @click="videoType = 'ai'"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">auto_awesome</span>AI 视频</button><button type="button" :class="{ active: videoType === 'real' }" @click="videoType = 'real'"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">videocam</span>实拍视频</button></div><div v-if="videoType === 'real'" class="need-field"><label>反推需求 <em>可选</em></label><textarea v-model="reverseNeed" placeholder="例如：侧重于运镜和字幕脚本分析..."></textarea><div><button type="button" @click="reverseNeed = '侧重于运镜和镜头节奏分析'">运镜节奏</button><button type="button" @click="reverseNeed = '侧重于字幕脚本和 CTA 结构分析'">字幕脚本</button></div></div><p v-else class="mode-hint"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">bolt</span>自动反推画面、运镜、光线与生成提示词</p></section>
        <section class="premium-panel preview-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><span class="material-symbols-outlined panel-icon">play_circle</span><strong>视频预览</strong></div><small>{{ hasVideo ? '00:00 / 00:12' : 'WAITING FOR INPUT' }}</small></div><div class="skeleton-player" :class="{ scanning: isScanning, loaded: hasVideo }"><div v-if="isScanning" class="scan-beam" /><div class="skeleton-grid" /><div class="skeleton-center"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">{{ hasVideo ? 'play_circle' : 'movie' }}</span><p>{{ hasVideo ? '分析准备中' : '等待视频载入' }}</p><small>{{ hasVideo ? '识别画面与声音...' : '选择左侧输入方式' }}</small></div><div v-if="isScanning" class="scan-badge"><i /> AI 多模态解析中</div></div><div class="mini-controls"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">play_arrow</span><div><i :class="{ loaded: hasVideo }" /></div><span>00:12</span></div></section><button type="button" class="analyze-trigger" @click="startScan"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">auto_awesome</span>开始分析 <span>↗</span></button><p class="privacy-note"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">lock</span>本次分析后自动清理原始素材</p>
      </aside>

      <section class="premium-console"><div class="console-head"><div><p class="premium-overline">分析工作区</p><h2>{{ videoType === 'ai' ? 'AI 视频提示词' : '实拍视频拆解' }}</h2></div><div class="console-tools history-tools"><button type="button" class="history-trigger" :aria-expanded="historyOpen" @click="toggleHistory"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">history</span><span>反推历史</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined history-chevron">expand_more</span></button><div v-if="historyOpen" class="history-menu"><div class="history-menu-head"><strong>反推历史</strong><small>共 {{ reverseHistories.length }} 条记录</small></div><div v-for="item in reverseHistories" :key="item.id" class="history-item"><input v-model="item.name" aria-label="重命名历史记录"><time>{{ item.date }}</time></div></div></div></div>
        <Transition name="console-fade" mode="out-in"><div v-if="!analysisLoaded" key="loading" class="console-skeleton"><div /><div /><div /><div /></div><div v-else-if="videoType === 'ai'" key="ai" class="console-body"><div class="insight-grid"><article class="insight-card radar-card"><div class="section-caption"><span>AI DIMENSION RADAR</span><small>5 dimensions</small></div><div class="radar-visual"><svg viewBox="0 0 180 150" aria-label="AI 置信度雷达图"><polygon points="90,14 157,63 132,138 48,138 23,63" fill="none" stroke="#e7e6f3" /><polygon points="90,34 137,68 120,120 60,120 43,68" fill="none" stroke="#eeedf6" /><polygon points="90,52 119,72 108,104 72,104 61,72" fill="none" stroke="#f2f1f8" /><path d="M90 24 L145 67 L123 128 L55 115 L40 68 Z" fill="rgba(92,82,229,.18)" stroke="#5c52e5" stroke-width="2" /><circle cx="90" cy="24" r="3" fill="#5c52e5" /><circle cx="145" cy="67" r="3" fill="#5c52e5" /><circle cx="123" cy="128" r="3" fill="#5c52e5" /><circle cx="55" cy="115" r="3" fill="#5c52e5" /><circle cx="40" cy="68" r="3" fill="#5c52e5" /><text x="90" y="10" text-anchor="middle">Lighting</text><text x="167" y="66">Motion</text><text x="132" y="149">Subject</text><text x="25" y="149">Setting</text><text x="2" y="66">Color</text></svg></div></article><article class="insight-card keyframe-card"><div class="section-caption"><span>KEYFRAMES</span><small>4 moments</small></div><div class="keyframe-row"><article v-for="frame in keyframes" :key="frame.time" class="keyframe"><div class="frame-art"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">movie</span><b>{{ frame.time }}</b></div><strong>{{ frame.title }}</strong><p>{{ frame.prompt }}</p></article></div></article></div><div class="section-caption prompt-caption"><span>PROMPT TERMINAL</span><small>typing synthesis complete</small></div><div class="code-editor typing-editor"><div class="editor-bar"><span><i /><i /><i /></span><small>reverse-engineering.prompt</small><button type="button" @click="copyPrompt">{{ copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy prompt' }}</button></div><pre><code><span class="line-num">01</span> <span class="syntax-purple">{{ displayPrompt }}</span><span class="typing-caret">▋</span><br><span class="line-num">02</span> <span class="syntax-teal">--ar 16:9</span> <span class="syntax-teal">--motion slow-pan</span></code></pre></div><div class="section-caption parameter-caption"><span>EXTRACTED PARAMETERS</span><small>6 fields</small></div><div class="parameter-grid"><div v-for="param in params" :key="param.key" class="parameter-row"><span>{{ param.key }}</span><strong :class="`tone-${param.tone}`">{{ param.value }}</strong></div></div><div class="console-footer"><button type="button" class="premium-primary" @click="generateSame"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">auto_awesome</span>一键生成同款视频 <span>↗</span></button><button type="button" class="premium-secondary" @click="copyPrompt"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">content_copy</span>{{ copied ? '已复制提示词' : '复制提示词' }}</button></div></div><div v-else-if="videoType === 'real'" key="real" class="console-body real-console"><div class="metric-row"><article v-for="metric in realMetrics" :key="metric.label" class="metric-card"><span>{{ metric.label }}</span><strong>{{ metric.value }}</strong><small :class="metric.tone">{{ metric.delta }}</small></article></div><div class="section-caption"><span>EMOTION CURVE / 情绪曲线</span><small>hover points for detail</small></div><div class="confidence-card detail-chart"><div class="confidence-label"><strong>Emotion &amp; retention signal</strong><span>0:00 <i /> 0:12</span></div><svg viewBox="0 0 720 80" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path :d="areaPath" fill="url(#confidenceFill)" /><path :d="chartPath" fill="none" stroke="#5c52e5" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" /></svg><div class="chart-tooltip"><b>00:05</b><span>情绪峰值 92 · 留存 88%</span></div></div><div class="section-caption table-caption"><span>DEEP DIVE ANALYSIS / 深度解析表格</span><small>4 scenes detected</small></div><div class="deep-table"><div class="table-head"><span>TIME</span><span>SCENE</span><span>CAMERA WORK</span><span>EMOTION</span><span>PACING</span></div><TransitionGroup name="table-row" tag="div"><div v-for="(row, index) in deepRows" :key="row.time" class="table-row" :style="{ '--delay': `${index * 55}ms` }"><span class="mono-cell">{{ row.time }}</span><span>{{ row.scene }}</span><span><b class="camera-badge">{{ row.camera }}</b></span><span class="emotion-cell">{{ row.emotion }}</span><span class="score-cell"><i><em :style="{ width: `${row.score * 10}%` }" /></i><b>{{ row.score }}</b></span></div></TransitionGroup></div><div class="insights-grid"><article class="insight-good"><h3>🟢 爆款基因 <small>可复用亮点</small></h3><p>「强 Hook」在 3 秒内建立好奇，首帧信息密度领先。</p><p>「电影级光线」主体轮廓清晰，氛围统一。</p><p>「节奏递进」镜头长度随情绪自然收紧。</p></article><article class="insight-warn"><h3>🟠 诊断建议 <small>需优化缺漏</small></h3><p>00:09 后留存下降 8%，CTA 可提前 0.5 秒出现。</p><p>转场缺少声音桥，建议补充环境音衔接。</p><p>字幕信息略密，可减少一行辅助描述。</p></article></div><div class="console-footer"><button type="button" class="premium-primary" @click="startScan"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">download</span>导出拆解报告 <span>↗</span></button></div></div></Transition></section>
    </main>
  </div>
